Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.25,0:01:06.08,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(340,430)}蟹堡王
Dialogue: 1,0:01:04.27,0:01:06.08,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,要点什么吗
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.27,0:01:06.08,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Can I help you?
Dialogue: 1,0:01:06.08,0:01:07.58,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,要
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.08,0:01:07.58,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Yeah
Dialogue: 1,0:01:08.03,0:01:08.93,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我想想
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.03,0:01:08.93,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Let's see here
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.92,0:01:12.26,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(820,266)}菜单
Dialogue: 1,0:01:09.19,0:01:13.84,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,请问一下这个蟹堡儿童餐
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.19,0:01:13.84,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I have a question about the krabby kiddie meal
Dialogue: 1,0:01:14.00,0:01:18.25,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,真的真的真的很可爱吗
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.00,0:01:18.25,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Is it really, really, really cute?
Dialogue: 1,0:01:20.21,0:01:20.76,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,很可爱
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.21,0:01:20.76,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Adorable
Dialogue: 1,0:01:20.76,0:01:23.95,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,比一般的蟹黄堡还可爱吗
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.76,0:01:23.95,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Cuter than a regular Krabby Patty?
Dialogue: 1,0:01:23.95,0:01:24.55,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,对
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.95,0:01:24.55,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Yes
Dialogue: 1,0:01:26.15,0:01:28.22,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,派大星  买蟹堡儿童餐吧
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.15,0:01:28.22,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Patrick, get the krabby kiddie meal
Dialogue: 1,0:01:28.22,0:01:30.21,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你看  这是一般的蟹黄堡
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.22,0:01:30.21,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Look, a regular Krabby Patty here
Dialogue: 1,0:01:30.93,0:01:32.73,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,这是儿童蟹堡
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.93,0:01:32.73,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,A Krabby Kiddie Patty here
Dialogue: 1,0:01:32.73,0:01:35.94,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,只要多花一块钱就能可爱三成
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.73,0:01:35.94,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,30% cuter, and it only costs $1 more
Dialogue: 1,0:01:36.42,0:01:36.96,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,好啊
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.42,0:01:36.96,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah
Dialogue: 1,0:01:36.96,0:01:37.54,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,好好好
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.96,0:01:37.54,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Yeah, yeah, yeah
Dialogue: 1,0:01:37.54,0:01:38.28,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,就要那个了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.54,0:01:38.28,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I want that
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.53,0:01:42.91,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(566,768)}儿童餐
Dialogue: 1,0:01:42.92,0:01:44.62,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,一共四块九毛九
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.92,0:01:44.62,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,That'll be $4.99
Dialogue: 1,0:01:46.67,0:01:47.72,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,这么多够吗
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.67,0:01:47.72,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Is this enough?
Dialogue: 1,0:01:48.79,0:01:50.17,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不够
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.79,0:01:50.17,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,No
Dialogue: 1,0:01:50.17,0:01:51.25,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,抱歉  派大星
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.17,0:01:51.25,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Sorry, Patrick
Dialogue: 1,0:01:51.25,0:01:53.05,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,该死
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.25,0:01:53.05,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Oh, crud
Dialogue: 1,0:01:53.05,0:01:55.67,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我身上就这么多
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.05,0:01:55.67,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,That's everything I got
Dialogue: 1,0:01:57.01,0:01:58.00,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我有个办法
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.01,0:01:58.00,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I have an idea
Dialogue: 1,0:01:58.00,0:02:00.43,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,可以一起买  一起分享
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.00,0:02:00.43,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,We can buy it together and share it
Dialogue: 1,0:02:00.43,0:02:01.26,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,分享
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.43,0:02:01.26,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Share it?
Dialogue: 1,0:02:01.26,0:02:02.14,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,没错
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.26,0:02:02.14,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Sure
Dialogue: 1,0:02:02.14,0:02:05.43,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,跟你说  分享就是世上最美妙
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.14,0:02:05.43,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You see, sharing is the most wonderful--
Dialogue: 1,0:02:05.43,0:02:06.64,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,好好好
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.43,0:02:06.64,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Yeah, yeah, yeah
Dialogue: 1,0:02:07.47,0:02:10.67,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,分享的概念我很熟
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.47,0:02:10.67,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'm familiar with the concept of sharing
Dialogue: 1,0:02:14.39,0:02:16.02,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,分享可好玩了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.39,0:02:16.02,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Sharing is fun
Dialogue: 1,0:02:17.49,0:02:18.57,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,对吧  海绵宝宝
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.49,0:02:18.57,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,huh, SpongeBob?
Dialogue: 1,0:02:19.15,0:02:20.49,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,对啊
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.15,0:02:20.49,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah
Dialogue: 1,0:02:22.50,0:02:24.20,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你要给我留一点吗
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.50,0:02:24.20,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Are you gonna save some of that for me?
Dialogue: 1,0:02:24.50,0:02:25.29,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,什么
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.50,0:02:25.29,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 1,0:02:25.85,0:02:26.37,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,没事
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.85,0:02:26.37,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Nothing
Dialogue: 1,0:02:28.21,0:02:28.96,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,玩具呢
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.21,0:02:28.96,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Where's the toy?
Dialogue: 1,0:02:29.15,0:02:30.30,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,根本没配玩具
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.15,0:02:30.30,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,It doesn't come with a toy
Dialogue: 1,0:02:30.30,0:02:30.82,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,什么
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.30,0:02:30.82,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 1,0:02:30.82,0:02:32.32,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,也太抢钱了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.82,0:02:32.32,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,That's a rip-off
Dialogue: 1,0:02:32.32,0:02:33.80,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我要退钱
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.32,0:02:33.80,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I want my money back
Dialogue: 1,0:02:35.05,0:02:36.17,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,退钱
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.05,0:02:36.17,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Money back?
Dialogue: 1,0:02:36.89,0:02:38.88,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,出了什么事
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.89,0:02:38.88,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What's the problem here?
Dialogue: 1,0:02:38.88,0:02:41.34,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我的儿童餐没配玩具
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.88,0:02:41.34,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,My kiddie meal didn't come with a toy
Dialogue: 1,0:02:42.31,0:02:45.87,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你想升级到玩具包
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.31,0:02:45.87,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,And you'd like to upgrade to the toy package
Dialogue: 1,0:02:45.87,0:02:46.23,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,对吧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.87,0:02:46.23,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Is that right?
Dialogue: 1,0:02:46.37,0:02:48.40,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,蟹老板  蟹堡王没有玩具
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.37,0:02:48.40,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Mr. Krabs, the Krusty Krab doesn't have any toys
Dialogue: 1,0:02:48.79,0:02:50.03,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,是吗
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.79,0:02:50.03,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 1,0:02:52.77,0:02:54.45,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,那你要怎么称呼
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.77,0:02:54.45,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Then what do you call
Dialogue: 1,0:02:55.55,0:02:56.57,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,这个
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.55,0:02:56.57,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,This?
Dialogue: 1,0:02:58.27,0:03:01.37,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,蟹堡王官方授权玩具
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.27,0:03:01.37,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,An official Krusty Krab licensed toy?
Dialogue: 1,0:03:10.25,0:03:11.80,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我一生的目标
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.25,0:03:11.80,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,My purpose in life
Dialogue: 1,0:03:12.05,0:03:14.86,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,就是拥有你当玩具
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.05,0:03:14.86,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,is to have you as my toy
Dialogue: 1,0:03:18.71,0:03:19.85,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,恶心
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.71,0:03:19.85,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Disgusting
Dialogue: 1,0:03:20.76,0:03:23.01,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,没错  就是可特别了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.76,0:03:23.01,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Yep, it's pretty special, all right
Dialogue: 1,0:03:23.01,0:03:25.21,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,想要拥有  只要付
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.01,0:03:25.21,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,And it can be yours for only--
Dialogue: 1,0:03:29.07,0:03:30.27,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,太好看了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.07,0:03:30.27,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Good-looking
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.73,0:03:38.19,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(732,888)}请勿打扰
Dialogue: 1,0:03:39.21,0:03:42.25,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我爱你  官方授权蟹黄堡玩具
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.21,0:03:42.25,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I love you, officially licensed Krabby Patty toy
Dialogue: 1,0:03:42.25,0:03:43.40,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不对  太正式了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.25,0:03:43.40,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,No, too formal
Dialogue: 1,0:03:45.00,0:03:47.64,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我要叫你
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.00,0:03:47.64,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I think I'll call you
Dialogue: 1,0:03:48.45,0:03:49.91,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,蟹堡宝
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.45,0:03:49.91,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Patty pal
Dialogue: 1,0:03:58.76,0:04:00.00,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我打扰到了你吗
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.76,0:04:00.00,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Am I interrupting?
Dialogue: 1,0:04:00.21,0:04:00.93,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,派大星
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.21,0:04:00.93,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Hey, Patrick
Dialogue: 1,0:04:00.93,0:04:02.60,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,见过我的新玩具没
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.93,0:04:02.60,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Have you met my new toy?
Dialogue: 1,0:04:02.60,0:04:05.05,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不是我们的新玩具吗
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.60,0:04:05.05,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Don't you mean our new toy?
Dialogue: 1,0:04:05.06,0:04:06.15,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我们的新玩具
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.06,0:04:06.15,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Our new toy?
Dialogue: 1,0:04:06.15,0:04:08.10,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,随餐附赠的  正好那餐是我们
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.15,0:04:08.10,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,It came from the meal that we're
Dialogue: 1,0:04:09.42,0:04:10.18,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,分享的
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.42,0:04:10.18,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,"Sharing"
Dialogue: 1,0:04:10.41,0:04:11.19,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,分享的吗
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.41,0:04:11.19,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Sharing?
Dialogue: 1,0:04:12.00,0:04:12.89,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,忘了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.00,0:04:12.89,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Remember?
Dialogue: 1,0:04:12.89,0:04:16.81,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,分享就是世上最美妙的感情
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.89,0:04:16.81,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,"Sharing is the most wonderful feeling in the world
Dialogue: 1,0:04:16.81,0:04:19.64,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,好比与神奇海马共舞
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.81,0:04:19.64,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,"like dancing with a magical sea horse
Dialogue: 1,0:04:19.65,0:04:22.11,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,踏过魔幻海草园
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.65,0:04:22.11,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,through an enchanted kelp garden"
Dialogue: 1,0:04:22.22,0:04:24.29,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,还记得那些话吗  海绵宝宝
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.22,0:04:24.29,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Remember those words, SpongeBob?
Dialogue: 1,0:04:24.29,0:04:25.45,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我没说过
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.29,0:04:25.45,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I didn't say that
Dialogue: 1,0:04:25.45,0:04:28.70,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不过应该是可以分享蟹堡宝吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.45,0:04:28.70,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,But I guess we can share Patty pal
Dialogue: 1,0:04:31.25,0:04:32.58,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,能再见它一面吗  派大星
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.25,0:04:32.58,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Now can I see it again, Patrick?
Dialogue: 1,0:04:32.58,0:04:33.09,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,什么
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.58,0:04:33.09,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 1,0:04:33.09,0:04:34.54,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我们明明是在分享
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.09,0:04:34.54,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I thought we were sharing it
Dialogue: 1,0:04:34.54,0:04:35.50,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,什么时候轮到我
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.54,0:04:35.50,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,When's my turn?
Dialogue: 1,0:04:35.50,0:04:39.01,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你不是应该工作吗
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.50,0:04:39.01,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Aren't you supposed to be working?
Dialogue: 1,0:04:43.42,0:04:44.41,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,没错
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.42,0:04:44.41,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Of course
Dialogue: 1,0:04:47.65,0:04:48.78,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,现在轮到我了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.65,0:04:48.78,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Now is it my turn?
Dialogue: 1,0:04:48.78,0:04:49.22,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,没有
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.78,0:04:49.22,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,No
Dialogue: 1,0:04:53.37,0:04:54.10,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,现在呢
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.37,0:04:54.10,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,How 'bout now?
Dialogue: 1,0:04:54.10,0:04:54.70,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,没
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.10,0:04:54.70,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Nah
Dialogue: 1,0:04:54.88,0:04:55.82,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,还是明天吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.88,0:04:55.82,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Maybe tomorrow
Dialogue: 1,0:04:57.04,0:04:58.61,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,晚安了  蟹堡宝
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.04,0:04:58.61,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Night-night, Patty pal
Dialogue: 1,0:04:58.61,0:04:59.25,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不许碰
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.61,0:04:59.25,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,No touching
Dialogue: 1,0:04:59.62,0:05:00.71,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,明天见
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.62,0:05:00.71,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,See you tomorrow
Dialogue: 1,0:05:04.20,0:05:05.77,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,说晚安吧  蟹堡宝
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.20,0:05:05.77,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Say good night, Patty pal
Dialogue: 1,0:05:06.41,0:05:08.41,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,晚安  海绵宝宝
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.41,0:05:08.41,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Good night, SpongeBob
Dialogue: 1,0:05:10.05,0:05:11.10,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,晚安
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.05,0:05:11.10,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Good night
Dialogue: 1,0:05:18.23,0:05:19.52,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,派大星真可怜
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.23,0:05:19.52,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Poor Patrick
Dialogue: 1,0:05:19.52,0:05:22.14,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,他就只能今晚玩蟹堡宝
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.52,0:05:22.14,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,He's only got the Patty pal for tonight
Dialogue: 1,0:05:22.14,0:05:23.51,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,到时候他肯定会睡着
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.14,0:05:23.51,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,and he'll be asleep
Dialogue: 1,0:05:23.51,0:05:25.68,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,完全玩不了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.51,0:05:25.68,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,and won't get to play with it at all
Dialogue: 1,0:05:55.22,0:05:55.80,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,好耶
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.22,0:05:55.80,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Yes
Dialogue: 1,0:05:55.80,0:05:57.91,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,今天轮到我玩蟹堡宝了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.80,0:05:57.91,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Today is my Patty pal day
Dialogue: 1,0:05:58.16,0:05:59.75,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,一定会特好玩
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.16,0:05:59.75,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,This is gonna be fun
Dialogue: 1,0:06:01.10,0:06:02.24,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,小蜗  派大星当然会
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.10,0:06:02.24,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Gary, of course Patrick
Dialogue: 1,0:06:02.24,0:06:04.02,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,把蟹堡宝轮给我玩
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.24,0:06:04.02,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,will give me my turn with the Patty pal
Dialogue: 1,0:06:05.23,0:06:07.52,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,小蜗  你也太悲观了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.23,0:06:07.52,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Gary, you can be a real negative Nancy
Dialogue: 1,0:06:12.94,0:06:14.22,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我都听见了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.94,0:06:14.22,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I heard that
Dialogue: 1,0:06:15.37,0:06:16.30,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,分享
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.37,0:06:16.30,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Sharing
Dialogue: 1,0:06:17.17,0:06:18.02,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,关爱
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.17,0:06:18.02,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Caring
Dialogue: 1,0:06:18.02,0:06:19.01,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,轮换
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.02,0:06:19.01,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Taking turns
Dialogue: 1,0:06:26.17,0:06:28.20,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,早安  派大星
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.17,0:06:28.20,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Good morning, Patrick
Dialogue: 1,0:06:30.97,0:06:32.37,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我现在不在家
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.97,0:06:32.37,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'm not home right now
Dialogue: 1,0:06:32.37,0:06:33.60,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,请留言
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.37,0:06:33.60,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Please leave a message
Dialogue: 1,0:06:35.52,0:06:38.63,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,派大星  是我海绵宝宝
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.52,0:06:38.63,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Patrick, it's me, SpongeBob
Dialogue: 1,0:06:38.63,0:06:40.61,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,轮到我玩玩具了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.63,0:06:40.61,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,It's my turn to play with the toy
Dialogue: 1,0:06:40.61,0:06:41.87,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我出不来
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.61,0:06:41.87,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I can't go out
Dialogue: 1,0:06:42.26,0:06:43.62,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,才刚洗过头发
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.26,0:06:43.62,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I just washed my hair
Dialogue: 1,0:06:43.96,0:06:45.57,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你根本就没
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.96,0:06:45.57,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You don't have any--
Dialogue: 1,0:06:45.57,0:06:46.71,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,快出来  派大星
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.57,0:06:46.71,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,come on out, Patrick
Dialogue: 1,0:06:46.71,0:06:47.88,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,轮到我了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.71,0:06:47.88,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,It's my turn
Dialogue: 1,0:06:47.88,0:06:49.12,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,有身份证吗
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.88,0:06:49.12,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Got any I.D.?
Dialogue: 1,0:06:50.34,0:06:52.76,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我有奶昔机操作执照
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.34,0:06:52.76,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I have my milk shake dispenser operator's license
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.01,0:06:54.01,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(336,264)}奶昔执照
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.01,0:06:54.01,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(848,880)}海绵宝宝
Dialogue: 1,0:06:56.91,0:06:58.42,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,一看就是假的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.91,0:06:58.42,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Looks fake to me, pal
Dialogue: 1,0:06:58.42,0:06:59.15,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,再见了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.42,0:06:59.15,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Bye-bye, now
Dialogue: 1,0:07:00.26,0:07:03.28,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,看来我只好走了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.26,0:07:03.28,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Well, I guess I had best be going
Dialogue: 1,0:07:03.53,0:07:05.60,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我要走了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.53,0:07:05.60,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'm walking away
Dialogue: 1,0:07:06.07,0:07:07.51,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,真走了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.07,0:07:07.51,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Here I go
Dialogue: 1,0:07:11.38,0:07:13.30,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我已经走了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.38,0:07:13.30,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'm gone now
Dialogue: 1,0:07:13.30,0:07:14.23,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你确定吗
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.30,0:07:14.23,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Are you sure?
Dialogue: 1,0:07:14.23,0:07:16.00,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,非常确定
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.23,0:07:16.00,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Pretty sure
Dialogue: 1,0:07:18.57,0:07:20.13,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,嗨  派大星
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.57,0:07:20.13,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Hi, Patrick
Dialogue: 1,0:07:20.13,0:07:21.68,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,该分享了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.13,0:07:21.68,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Time to share
Dialogue: 1,0:07:21.68,0:07:22.91,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,骗子
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.68,0:07:22.91,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Deceiver
Dialogue: 1,0:07:22.91,0:07:24.28,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你根本就没走
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.91,0:07:24.28,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You didn't leave at all
Dialogue: 1,0:07:24.51,0:07:26.16,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你还洗头发呢
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.51,0:07:26.16,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,And you were washing your hair?
Dialogue: 1,0:07:26.16,0:07:26.92,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我真洗了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.16,0:07:26.92,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I was too
Dialogue: 1,0:07:26.92,0:07:27.60,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你看
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.92,0:07:27.60,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,See?
Dialogue: 1,0:07:35.17,0:07:36.17,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,跳得不错
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.17,0:07:36.17,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Nice dismount
Dialogue: 1,0:07:36.17,0:07:37.54,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我有在锻炼
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.17,0:07:37.54,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I've been working out
Dialogue: 1,0:07:37.54,0:07:38.70,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,该走了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.54,0:07:38.70,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Well, got to go
Dialogue: 1,0:07:38.70,0:07:40.05,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,先别急着走  讨厌鬼
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.70,0:07:40.05,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Hold on, buster
Dialogue: 1,0:07:42.34,0:07:43.93,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,交出玩具
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.34,0:07:43.93,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Hand over the toy
Dialogue: 1,0:07:43.93,0:07:45.31,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,轮到我了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.93,0:07:45.31,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,It's my turn
Dialogue: 1,0:07:45.31,0:07:46.07,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不行
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.31,0:07:46.07,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I can't
Dialogue: 1,0:07:46.72,0:07:48.86,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我跟蟹堡宝已经建立起了深深的联系
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.72,0:07:48.86,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Patty pal and me have really bonded
Dialogue: 1,0:07:50.26,0:07:52.28,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,小蜗还真说中了你的品行
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.26,0:07:52.28,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Gary was so right about you
Dialogue: 1,0:07:52.28,0:07:53.95,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你压根不会分享
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.28,0:07:53.95,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You're a non-sharer
Dialogue: 1,0:07:53.95,0:07:55.03,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,小蜗说的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.95,0:07:55.03,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Gary said that?
Dialogue: 1,0:07:55.27,0:07:57.33,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我跟你绝交  小蜗
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.27,0:07:57.33,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You're off my friend list, Gary
Dialogue: 1,0:08:00.92,0:08:02.48,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,交出来  派大星
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.92,0:08:02.48,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Hand it over, Patrick
Dialogue: 1,0:08:02.48,0:08:04.40,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我今天要玩蟹堡宝
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.48,0:08:04.40,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I get to play with the Patty pal today
Dialogue: 1,0:08:04.40,0:08:05.92,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不能带走它
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.40,0:08:05.92,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You can't take it
Dialogue: 1,0:08:05.92,0:08:07.35,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,这样不公平
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.92,0:08:07.35,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,It's not fair
Dialogue: 1,0:08:07.82,0:08:10.18,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不然我就只玩半天
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.82,0:08:10.18,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,How 'bout I only take it for half a day?
Dialogue: 1,0:08:11.10,0:08:13.24,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不然每小时换一次
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.10,0:08:13.24,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,How 'bout we trade off every hour?
Dialogue: 1,0:08:14.10,0:08:15.05,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,每半小时
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.10,0:08:15.05,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Every half hour?
Dialogue: 1,0:08:15.73,0:08:16.69,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,每十五分钟
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.73,0:08:16.69,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Every 15 minutes?
Dialogue: 1,0:08:17.30,0:08:18.04,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,五分钟
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.30,0:08:18.04,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Five minutes?
Dialogue: 1,0:08:18.32,0:08:19.06,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,一分钟
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.32,0:08:19.06,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,One minute?
Dialogue: 1,0:08:20.09,0:08:21.12,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不行
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.09,0:08:21.12,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,N-N-No
Dialogue: 1,0:08:21.12,0:08:22.60,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,好  最后条件
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.12,0:08:22.60,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Okay, my final offer
Dialogue: 1,0:08:22.60,0:08:23.91,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,每秒钟换一次
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.60,0:08:23.91,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,We trade off every second
Dialogue: 1,0:08:24.52,0:08:25.05,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,一秒
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.52,0:08:25.05,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,One
Dialogue: 1,0:08:26.08,0:08:26.71,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,一秒
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.08,0:08:26.71,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,One
Dialogue: 1,0:08:28.80,0:08:29.72,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,一秒
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.80,0:08:29.72,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,One
Dialogue: 1,0:08:59.39,0:09:00.77,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我恨他们
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.39,0:09:00.77,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I hate them
Dialogue: 1,0:09:04.89,0:09:06.36,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你们好啊  海绵宝宝派大星
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.89,0:09:06.36,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Howdy, Patrick, SpongeBob
Dialogue: 1,0:09:07.72,0:09:09.03,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,嗨  珊迪
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.72,0:09:09.03,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Hi, Sandy
Dialogue: 1,0:09:09.33,0:09:11.49,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你们两个是怎么了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.33,0:09:11.49,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What in tarnation's going on with you two?
Dialogue: 1,0:09:11.50,0:09:14.15,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,海绵宝宝不让我玩我的玩具
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.50,0:09:14.15,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,SpongeBob won't let me play with my toy
Dialogue: 1,0:09:14.15,0:09:16.12,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,派大星不分享我们的玩具
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.15,0:09:16.12,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Patrick won't share our toy
Dialogue: 1,0:09:16.12,0:09:18.45,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,所以得好好调解一下你们
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.12,0:09:18.45,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What you need is a mediator
Dialogue: 1,0:09:18.67,0:09:21.33,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,坐好了  有事好商量
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.67,0:09:21.33,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Y'all best sit down and work this out
Dialogue: 1,0:09:21.33,0:09:23.13,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,冲突最主要的问题
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.33,0:09:23.13,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Now, the main problem in an argument
Dialogue: 1,0:09:23.13,0:09:24.91,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,就在于缺乏沟通
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.13,0:09:24.91,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,is a lack of communication
Dialogue: 1,0:09:24.91,0:09:27.92,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,只有互相理解  才能解决冲突
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.91,0:09:26.33,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You can only resolve conflict
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.33,0:09:27.92,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,when you understand each other
Dialogue: 1,0:09:27.92,0:09:29.37,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,所以我要你们各自说明
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.92,0:09:29.37,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,So I want each of you to state
Dialogue: 1,0:09:29.37,0:09:31.75,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,现在什么东西对你们来说最重要
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.37,0:09:31.75,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,what is most important to each of you right now
Dialogue: 1,0:09:32.82,0:09:35.26,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,水
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.82,0:09:35.26,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Water
Dialogue: 1,0:09:47.94,0:09:48.47,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,天啊
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.94,0:09:48.47,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Boy
Dialogue: 1,0:09:49.61,0:09:51.70,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,那个调解的说得有道理
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.61,0:09:51.70,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,That mediator lady made some good points
Dialogue: 1,0:09:51.70,0:09:52.98,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,没错
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.70,0:09:52.98,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Most definitely
Dialogue: 1,0:09:52.98,0:09:55.02,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,需要理解
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.98,0:09:55.02,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,It takes understanding
Dialogue: 1,0:09:55.02,0:09:56.85,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,关键在沟通
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.02,0:09:56.85,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Communication is key
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.17,0:10:12.80,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(870,570)}地铁
Dialogue: 1,0:10:12.32,0:10:12.80,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,给我
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.32,0:10:12.80,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Gimme
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.80,0:10:13.55,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(750,224)}裤头村站
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.30,0:10:15.13,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1014,174)}巴利芒
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.63,0:10:18.63,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(854,238)}裤头村站
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.39,0:10:23.18,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(416,416)}地铁
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.39,0:10:22.68,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(922,522)}出租船
Dialogue: 1,0:10:25.19,0:10:25.67,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,给我
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.19,0:10:25.67,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Gimme
Dialogue: 1,0:10:26.92,0:10:27.49,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,给我
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.92,0:10:27.49,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Gimme
Dialogue: 1,0:10:29.34,0:10:29.75,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,给我
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.34,0:10:29.75,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Gimme
Dialogue: 1,0:10:31.21,0:10:31.67,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,拿来
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.21,0:10:31.67,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Give it
Dialogue: 1,0:10:31.67,0:10:32.62,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,是我的
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.67,0:10:32.62,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,It's mine
Dialogue: 1,0:10:34.02,0:10:35.52,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,轮到我了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.02,0:10:35.52,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,It's my turn
Dialogue: 1,0:10:35.52,0:10:36.58,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不对  是我的
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.52,0:10:36.58,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,No, it's mine
Dialogue: 1,0:10:36.58,0:10:37.36,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我的
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.58,0:10:37.36,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Mine
Dialogue: 1,0:10:39.53,0:10:41.05,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我玩不到
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.53,0:10:41.05,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,If I can't have it
Dialogue: 1,0:10:41.47,0:10:42.56,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,就都不准玩
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.47,0:10:42.56,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,no one can
Dialogue: 1,0:10:47.87,0:10:51.04,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不要
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.87,0:10:51.04,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,No
Dialogue: 1,0:10:51.04,0:10:53.13,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,且慢  小子们
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.04,0:10:53.13,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Avast, there, laddies
Dialogue: 1,0:10:53.13,0:10:55.37,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,这都是在吵什么啊
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.13,0:10:55.37,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What's all this ruckarus about now?
Dialogue: 1,0:10:55.37,0:10:57.42,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,都是我们的蟹黄堡玩具  蟹老板
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.37,0:10:57.42,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,It's our Krabby Patty toy, Mr. Krabs
Dialogue: 1,0:10:57.42,0:10:59.55,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,被派大星给吃了  害我没得玩了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.42,0:10:59.55,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,and Patrick ate it so that I couldn't play with it
Dialogue: 1,0:10:59.55,0:11:01.59,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,海绵宝宝不让我玩
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.55,0:11:01.59,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,SpongeBob won't let me play with it
Dialogue: 1,0:11:01.59,0:11:03.22,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,还不是怪你整晚都在霸占
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.59,0:11:03.22,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Only because you hogged it all night
Dialogue: 1,0:11:03.22,0:11:03.92,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,才没有
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.22,0:11:03.92,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I did not
Dialogue: 1,0:11:03.92,0:11:04.72,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,就有
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.92,0:11:04.72,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Did too
Dialogue: 1,0:11:04.72,0:11:05.70,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,没
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.72,0:11:05.70,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Nuh-uh
Dialogue: 1,0:11:06.10,0:11:07.46,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你会吃玩具
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.10,0:11:07.46,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You toy eater
Dialogue: 1,0:11:07.46,0:11:08.06,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,告密者
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.46,0:11:08.06,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Tattletale
Dialogue: 1,0:11:09.47,0:11:11.02,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,都别急
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.47,0:11:11.02,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Now, settle down
Dialogue: 1,0:11:11.26,0:11:13.69,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,打来打去  就只为了个玩具吗
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.26,0:11:13.69,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,All this brawling is over a toy?
Dialogue: 1,0:11:13.80,0:11:17.03,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不能因为这种鸡毛蒜皮的小事就决裂
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.80,0:11:15.94,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You two shouldn't let a little trinket
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.94,0:11:17.03,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,get between youse
Dialogue: 1,0:11:17.03,0:11:19.65,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你们应该为自己感到羞耻
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.03,0:11:19.65,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You should be ashamed of yourselves
Dialogue: 1,0:11:19.65,0:11:22.72,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我再给你们一人一个玩具
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.65,0:11:22.72,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,If I gave each of you another toy
Dialogue: 1,0:11:22.95,0:11:24.62,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,这下总能开心了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.95,0:11:24.62,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,would that make you happy?
Dialogue: 1,0:11:25.65,0:11:27.08,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,能
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.65,0:11:27.08,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Yes
Dialogue: 1,0:11:27.08,0:11:28.25,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你们运气不错
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.08,0:11:28.25,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Well, you're in luck
Dialogue: 1,0:11:28.25,0:11:30.56,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你们两个似乎玩玩具玩得特别激动
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.25,0:11:30.56,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You two seemed so thrilled with the toy
Dialogue: 1,0:11:30.56,0:11:32.75,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,所以我就做了一整箱
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.56,0:11:32.75,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I had an entire case of 'em made
Dialogue: 1,0:11:32.75,0:11:35.17,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,卖得可好了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.75,0:11:35.17,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,They been selling like hotcakes
Dialogue: 1,0:11:35.17,0:11:37.00,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,一个十三块五
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.17,0:11:37.00,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,That'll be $13.50 each
Dialogue: 1,0:11:37.00,0:11:39.27,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,这次我出钱
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.00,0:11:39.27,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,This time, it's on me
Dialogue: 1,0:11:40.88,0:11:42.71,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,派大星  那是我的钱
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.88,0:11:42.71,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Patrick, that's my money
Dialogue: 1,0:11:42.71,0:11:45.45,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你就没学会分享吗
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.71,0:11:45.45,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Have you learned nothing about sharing?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.43,0:11:50.94,起司 一般标题,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\fsp40}螃蟹小气鬼
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.14,0:11:53.44,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\frz29.85\pos(237.33,454)}分镜总监
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.14,0:11:53.44,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\frz29.85\pos(475.661,716)}编剧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.14,0:11:55.86,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1096,976.667)}翻译{\fnArial}: 1440kHz
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.52,0:11:55.86,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\frz29.85\pos(407.575,448)}创意总监
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.52,0:11:55.86,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\frz29.85\pos(527.742,702)}动画总监
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.98,0:11:58.48,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\frz29.85\pos(431.6,534)}制片指导
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.98,0:11:58.48,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1034.667,976.667)}本字幕仅限学习交流\N严禁用于商业用途
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.48,0:12:00.44,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(410,416)}蟹堡王
Dialogue: 1,0:12:00.44,0:12:03.86,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,海绵宝宝  一份特大份海薯条
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.44,0:12:03.86,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,SpongeBob, one extra large order of sea fries
Dialogue: 1,0:12:03.86,0:12:05.25,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,还有呢
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.86,0:12:05.25,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,And?
Dialogue: 1,0:12:07.32,0:12:08.62,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,麻烦你了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.32,0:12:08.62,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Please
Dialogue: 1,0:12:08.62,0:12:10.12,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不算太难  对吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.62,0:12:10.12,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Now, that wasn't so hard, was it?
Dialogue: 1,0:12:10.40,0:12:11.20,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,很难
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.40,0:12:11.20,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Yes
Dialogue: 1,0:12:11.20,0:12:11.87,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,难死我了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.20,0:12:11.87,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Yes, it was
Dialogue: 1,0:12:12.24,0:12:14.17,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,一份大份海薯条马上就来
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.24,0:12:14.17,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,One large sea fries coming up
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.17,0:12:18.21,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(706,876)}海土豆
Dialogue: 1,0:12:42.55,0:12:45.70,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,一份大份海薯条  加倍搞怪
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.55,0:12:45.70,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,One large sea fries, extra weird
Dialogue: 1,0:12:46.37,0:12:49.49,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,海绵宝宝
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.37,0:12:49.49,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,SpongeBob
Dialogue: 1,0:12:49.49,0:12:51.11,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,到我办公室报到
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.49,0:12:51.11,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Please report to me office
Dialogue: 1,0:12:53.76,0:12:54.96,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,听好了  小子
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.76,0:12:54.96,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Now, listen up, son
Dialogue: 1,0:12:54.96,0:12:57.57,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我叫你来  是要执行蟹堡王的公务
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.96,0:12:57.57,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I've called you here on official Krusty Krab business
Dialogue: 1,0:12:57.57,0:12:59.59,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我的小气鬼螃蟹同行每年都会
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.57,0:12:59.59,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Every year, me fellow cheapskate crabs
Dialogue: 1,0:12:59.59,0:13:03.06,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,开会讨论工作场所小气新妙招
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.59,0:13:01.21,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,meet to discuss new ways
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.21,0:13:03.06,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,of being stingy in the workplace
Dialogue: 1,0:13:03.06,0:13:04.08,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不仅如此
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.06,0:13:04.08,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,but more than that
Dialogue: 1,0:13:04.08,0:13:07.47,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,还会颁发最小气螃蟹奖
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.08,0:13:07.47,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,they bestow the award for cheapest crab
Dialogue: 1,0:13:07.47,0:13:10.35,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,今年  我得到了提名
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.47,0:13:10.35,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,and this year, I've been nominated
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.35,0:13:15.44,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(982,884)}小气螃蟹联盟很荣幸\N提名蟹老板最小气螃蟹奖
Dialogue: 1,0:13:11.52,0:13:12.21,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,螃蟹
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.52,0:13:12.21,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Crabs
Dialogue: 1,0:13:12.52,0:13:13.36,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,得到提名
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.52,0:13:13.36,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,nominated
Dialogue: 1,0:13:13.75,0:13:14.48,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,奖
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.75,0:13:14.48,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Award--
Dialogue: 1,0:13:14.67,0:13:15.44,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,奖
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.67,0:13:15.44,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,award?
Dialogue: 1,0:13:15.44,0:13:18.55,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,所以我得出差去参加颁奖典礼
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.44,0:13:18.55,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,So I'll be out of town for the award ceremony
Dialogue: 1,0:13:18.55,0:13:20.45,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你跟我一起来
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.55,0:13:20.45,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,and you're coming with me
Dialogue: 1,0:13:20.45,0:13:23.68,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,公路旅行
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.45,0:13:23.68,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Road trip
Dialogue: 1,0:13:24.48,0:13:26.40,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,这次旅行  我要向你传授
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.48,0:13:26.40,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,On this trip, I'm gonna teach you
Dialogue: 1,0:13:26.40,0:13:28.25,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我所有的小气绝学
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.40,0:13:28.25,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,all me cheapskate knowledge
Dialogue: 1,0:13:28.25,0:13:30.78,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,把你当作我从不想要的儿子看待
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.25,0:13:30.78,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,like you were the son I never wanted
Dialogue: 1,0:13:31.87,0:13:32.96,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我可以叫你老爸吗
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.87,0:13:32.96,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Can I call you daddy?
Dialogue: 1,0:13:33.36,0:13:33.79,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不行
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.36,0:13:33.79,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,No
Dialogue: 1,0:13:33.79,0:13:34.20,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,爸
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.79,0:13:34.20,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Pa?
Dialogue: 1,0:13:34.20,0:13:34.54,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不行
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.20,0:13:34.54,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,No
Dialogue: 1,0:13:34.54,0:13:34.96,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,爹
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.54,0:13:34.96,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Pop?
Dialogue: 1,0:13:34.96,0:13:35.16,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不行
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.96,0:13:35.16,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,No
Dialogue: 1,0:13:35.16,0:13:35.62,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,爸爸
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.16,0:13:35.62,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Papa?
Dialogue: 1,0:13:35.62,0:13:35.91,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不行
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.62,0:13:35.91,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,No
Dialogue: 1,0:13:35.91,0:13:36.67,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,家父
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.91,0:13:36.67,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,My old man?
Dialogue: 1,0:13:36.67,0:13:37.00,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不行
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.67,0:13:37.00,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,No
Dialogue: 1,0:13:37.00,0:13:37.75,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,粑粑
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.00,0:13:37.75,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Daddykins?
Dialogue: 1,0:13:37.75,0:13:38.21,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,也许
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.75,0:13:38.21,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Maybe
Dialogue: 1,0:13:38.21,0:13:38.83,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,老大爷
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.21,0:13:38.83,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Grampy Joe?
Dialogue: 1,0:13:39.47,0:13:39.87,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不行
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.47,0:13:39.87,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,No
Dialogue: 1,0:13:40.22,0:13:42.93,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,这对你可是天大的学习机会
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.22,0:13:42.93,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Now, this'll be a great learning experience for you
Dialogue: 1,0:13:42.93,0:13:44.67,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,给我动脑记好了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.93,0:13:44.67,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,so keep your brain peeled
Dialogue: 1,0:13:45.62,0:13:47.22,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,没问题  蟹老板
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.62,0:13:47.22,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Can do, Mr. Krabs
Dialogue: 1,0:13:47.22,0:13:48.55,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,应典礼惯例
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.22,0:13:48.55,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,And in the tradition of the event
Dialogue: 1,0:13:48.55,0:13:50.54,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,必须便宜出行
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.55,0:13:50.54,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,we are required to travel cheaply
Dialogue: 1,0:13:50.54,0:13:53.28,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我来教教你怎么出行最便宜
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.54,0:13:53.28,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,and I'm gonna teach you the cheapest way to do it
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.64,0:13:55.35,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(438,718)}欢迎小气鬼
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.64,0:13:55.35,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1078,402)}宾馆
Dialogue: 1,0:13:57.85,0:13:59.12,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,停航
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.85,0:13:59.12,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Heave
Dialogue: 1,0:14:05.41,0:14:08.07,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,各位与会的小气鬼请注意
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.41,0:14:08.07,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Attention, cheapskate attendees
Dialogue: 1,0:14:08.07,0:14:12.71,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我尤金蟹  这次出行只花了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.07,0:14:12.71,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I, Eugene krabs, have only spent on me travel
Dialogue: 1,0:14:12.71,0:14:15.70,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,一分邮票钱
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.71,0:14:15.70,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,the price of a 1¢ stamp
Dialogue: 1,0:14:18.45,0:14:19.17,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.45,0:14:19.17,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Thank you
Dialogue: 1,0:14:19.17,0:14:19.99,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.17,0:14:19.99,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Thank you
Dialogue: 1,0:14:20.37,0:14:22.47,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,倒要看看谁能比咱强
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.37,0:14:22.47,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'd like to see someone top that
Dialogue: 1,0:14:25.19,0:14:26.54,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,小气麦基
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.19,0:14:26.54,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Chintzy McGee?
Dialogue: 1,0:14:26.75,0:14:28.88,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,感谢你让我搭便车  老螃蟹
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.75,0:14:28.88,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Thanks for letting me hitch a ride, Krabs
Dialogue: 1,0:14:28.88,0:14:31.26,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,出行一分钱都不用花
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.88,0:14:31.26,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I didn't have to spend a penny on travel
Dialogue: 1,0:14:33.97,0:14:34.93,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,厉害
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.97,0:14:34.93,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Snap
Dialogue: 1,0:14:34.93,0:14:36.39,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,祝他别倒霉  小子
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.93,0:14:36.39,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Better wish him luck, kid
Dialogue: 1,0:14:36.60,0:14:37.60,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,他多半会栽
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.60,0:14:37.60,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,He'll need it
Dialogue: 1,0:14:37.98,0:14:38.97,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,祝你好运  蟹老板
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.98,0:14:38.97,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Good luck, Mr. Krabs
Dialogue: 1,0:14:39.44,0:14:40.15,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,走了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.44,0:14:40.15,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Come on
Dialogue: 1,0:14:43.46,0:14:45.32,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,您的房间  先生
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.46,0:14:45.32,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Your room, sir
Dialogue: 1,0:14:45.98,0:14:46.98,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,看见没  小子
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.98,0:14:46.98,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You see that, laddie?
Dialogue: 1,0:14:46.98,0:14:48.11,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,伸出来的手
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.98,0:14:48.11,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,The outstretched hand
Dialogue: 1,0:14:48.11,0:14:51.48,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,是成为真正小气鬼过程中的一大危险
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.11,0:14:49.66,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,is one of the biggest dangers
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.66,0:14:51.48,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,to becoming a true cheapskate
Dialogue: 1,0:14:51.68,0:14:53.63,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,他想要小费
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.68,0:14:53.63,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,He wants a tip
Dialogue: 1,0:14:53.63,0:14:55.24,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,什么是小费
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.63,0:14:55.24,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What's a tip?
Dialogue: 1,0:14:55.50,0:14:59.60,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,意思就是他平白无故要钱
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.50,0:14:59.60,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,It means he wants money for nothing
Dialogue: 1,0:14:59.99,0:15:01.44,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,仔细看好了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.99,0:15:01.44,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Now, watch closely
Dialogue: 1,0:15:02.58,0:15:04.01,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,给你吧  小子
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.58,0:15:04.01,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,There you are, lad
Dialogue: 1,0:15:05.60,0:15:06.63,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,才两毛五
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.60,0:15:06.63,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,A quarter
Dialogue: 1,0:15:07.19,0:15:09.52,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,先生  你可真是个小气鬼
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.19,0:15:09.52,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You, sir, are a real cheapskate
Dialogue: 1,0:15:09.52,0:15:10.57,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,多谢了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.52,0:15:10.57,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Why, thank you
Dialogue: 1,0:15:11.80,0:15:13.61,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,仔细看好了  小子
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.80,0:15:13.61,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Now, watch closely, boy
Dialogue: 1,0:15:13.61,0:15:14.96,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,先让人家走几步
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.61,0:15:14.96,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You give it a little lead
Dialogue: 1,0:15:14.96,0:15:16.86,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,再拉回来
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.96,0:15:16.86,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,and then snatch it back
Dialogue: 1,0:15:18.53,0:15:21.65,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,这个老哏已经见过不下十次了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.53,0:15:21.65,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Like I haven't already seen that gag ten times
Dialogue: 1,0:15:21.65,0:15:22.36,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,光是今天
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.65,0:15:22.36,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Today
Dialogue: 1,0:15:24.48,0:15:25.29,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,上吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.48,0:15:25.29,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Go ahead
Dialogue: 1,0:15:25.29,0:15:26.34,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,试试看
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.29,0:15:26.34,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Give it a try
Dialogue: 1,0:15:26.34,0:15:27.72,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,遵命  老板
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.34,0:15:27.72,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Aye, aye, sir
Dialogue: 1,0:15:29.44,0:15:30.64,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,给你  小子
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.44,0:15:30.64,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Here you are, sonny
Dialogue: 1,0:15:30.64,0:15:33.86,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,亮晶晶的两毛五
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.64,0:15:33.86,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,a nice shiny quarter
Dialogue: 1,0:15:40.19,0:15:41.16,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,快啊  小子
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.19,0:15:41.16,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Go on, boy
Dialogue: 1,0:15:41.16,0:15:42.37,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你的两毛五快跑走了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.16,0:15:42.37,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Your quarter's getting away
Dialogue: 1,0:15:48.65,0:15:50.15,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,别闹了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.65,0:15:50.15,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Quit fooling around
Dialogue: 1,0:15:50.15,0:15:51.36,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我还得去赢奖
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.15,0:15:51.36,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I got an award to win
Dialogue: 1,0:15:56.42,0:15:57.35,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我的两毛五
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.42,0:15:57.35,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,My quarter
Dialogue: 1,0:16:04.80,0:16:06.04,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,大家好
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.80,0:16:06.04,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Hi, fellers
Dialogue: 1,0:16:11.77,0:16:14.16,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,还知道小气鬼握手式吧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.77,0:16:14.16,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You still know the cheapskate handshake?
Dialogue: 1,0:16:14.16,0:16:15.45,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,那当然
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.16,0:16:15.45,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Of course
Dialogue: 1,0:16:15.62,0:16:17.48,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,一毛不拔  一毛不拔
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.62,0:16:17.48,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Penny pinching, penny pinching
Dialogue: 1,0:16:21.10,0:16:22.32,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,小气小气小气
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.10,0:16:22.32,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Cheap, cheap, cheap
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.10,0:16:22.32,注释,,0,0,0,,[ cheap（小气）与 cheep（鸟叫声）谐音 ]
Dialogue: 1,0:16:24.70,0:16:27.37,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我想介绍一下我的厨子  海绵宝宝
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.70,0:16:27.37,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'd like to introduce me fry cook, SpongeBob
Dialogue: 1,0:16:27.37,0:16:29.40,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我一直都在指点他呢
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.37,0:16:29.40,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I've been giving him some pointers
Dialogue: 1,0:16:30.32,0:16:32.71,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,训练他小气的门道是吗
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.32,0:16:32.71,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Training him in the cheapskate arts, eh?
Dialogue: 1,0:16:33.02,0:16:35.32,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你这可是在向大师学啊  小子
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.02,0:16:35.32,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You're learning from the master, kiddo
Dialogue: 1,0:16:35.32,0:16:37.36,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我做蟹黄堡的
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.32,0:16:37.36,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I cook krabby patties
Dialogue: 1,0:16:37.58,0:16:39.11,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,对对对  你做的
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.58,0:16:39.11,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Yes, sure, you do
Dialogue: 1,0:16:39.11,0:16:40.32,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,再见  老螃蟹
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.11,0:16:40.32,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Later, Krabs
Dialogue: 1,0:16:40.32,0:16:42.70,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,小子  四周到处都是小气智慧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.32,0:16:42.70,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Lad, you're surrounded by stingy wisdom
Dialogue: 1,0:16:42.70,0:16:44.72,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,尽量多学着点
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.70,0:16:44.72,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,so try to pick up some pointers
Dialogue: 1,0:16:44.72,0:16:48.61,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,但不管怎样都别把钱借给别人
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.72,0:16:48.61,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,but whatever you do, don't lend anyone money
Dialogue: 1,0:16:48.77,0:16:51.45,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,25  26
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.77,0:16:51.45,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,25, 26--
Dialogue: 1,0:16:53.62,0:16:54.57,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,好好应酬
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.62,0:16:54.57,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Let's mingle
Dialogue: 1,0:16:57.07,0:16:59.03,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,各位一毛不拔的小气鬼注意
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.07,0:16:59.03,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Attention, penny-pinchers
Dialogue: 1,0:17:00.90,0:17:01.37,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,什么
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.90,0:17:01.37,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 1,0:17:01.37,0:17:01.97,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,他说什么
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.37,0:17:01.97,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What'd he say?
Dialogue: 1,0:17:01.97,0:17:02.26,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,什么
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.97,0:17:02.26,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 1,0:17:05.07,0:17:06.73,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,一毛不拔
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.07,0:17:06.73,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Penny-pinchers
Dialogue: 1,0:17:07.66,0:17:11.63,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,现在颁发本年度最小气螃蟹奖
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.66,0:17:09.54,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,It's time to award the trophy
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.54,0:17:11.63,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,for this year's cheapest crab
Dialogue: 1,0:17:13.09,0:17:14.59,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,被提名者有
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.09,0:17:14.59,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,And the nominees are
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.76,0:17:20.43,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(454,414)}蟹堡王
Dialogue: 1,0:17:16.87,0:17:20.43,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,尤金蟹  按次计费标价牌
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.87,0:17:20.43,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Eugene Krabs in sign of the times
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.10,0:17:22.18,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(526,332)}免费蟹黄堡
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.57,0:17:34.32,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(698,816)}走一步一块钱
Dialogue: 1,0:17:31.23,0:17:32.60,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,走一步一块钱
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.23,0:17:32.60,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,$1 per footstep?
Dialogue: 1,0:17:32.60,0:17:34.32,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,根本付不起
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.60,0:17:34.32,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I can't afford that
Dialogue: 1,0:17:36.96,0:17:38.53,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,这还怎么出去
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.96,0:17:38.53,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,How do I get out of here?
Dialogue: 1,0:17:41.86,0:17:42.77,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.86,0:17:42.77,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Thank you
Dialogue: 1,0:17:42.77,0:17:43.58,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.77,0:17:43.58,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Thank you
Dialogue: 1,0:17:43.58,0:17:44.45,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,好家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.58,0:17:44.45,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Good stuff
Dialogue: 1,0:17:44.45,0:17:46.91,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,接下来是贝佛讨价佬
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.45,0:17:46.91,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Next up is Beuford Bargain Bottom
Dialogue: 1,0:17:46.91,0:17:49.67,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,便利店抢钱
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.91,0:17:49.67,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,in convenience store caper
Dialogue: 1,0:17:54.62,0:17:56.50,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你刷了我三次的钱
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.62,0:17:56.50,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You charged me three times
Dialogue: 1,0:17:56.50,0:17:59.05,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,对啊  三倍风味
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.50,0:17:59.05,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Yeah, three times the flavor
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.13,0:17:59.05,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(600,548)}三倍风味
Dialogue: 1,0:17:59.05,0:18:01.10,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,当然要三倍价格
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.05,0:18:01.10,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,three times the price
Dialogue: 1,0:18:03.92,0:18:08.33,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,以及吝啬杜莱  节外生纸
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.92,0:18:08.33,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,And Dwight T. Wad in tying up loose ends
Dialogue: 1,0:18:17.35,0:18:18.35,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,天啊
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.35,0:18:18.35,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Jeez
Dialogue: 1,0:18:18.35,0:18:21.49,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,没想到今年竞争这么激烈
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.35,0:18:19.66,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I didn't think the competition
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.66,0:18:21.49,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,would be so stiff this year
Dialogue: 1,0:18:21.67,0:18:23.28,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,这回一定得要你帮忙
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.67,0:18:23.28,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna need your help on this one
Dialogue: 1,0:18:27.91,0:18:31.54,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,也太标新立异了吧  不过也行
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.91,0:18:31.54,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Well, that's highly unconventional, but okay
Dialogue: 1,0:18:31.85,0:18:35.94,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,现在请听一名蟹堡王员工提供证明
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.85,0:18:33.75,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,We will now hear a testimony
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.75,0:18:35.94,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,from a Krusty Krab employee
Dialogue: 1,0:18:37.12,0:18:39.32,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你要证明我有多小气
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.12,0:18:39.32,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I need you to testify about how cheap I am
Dialogue: 1,0:18:39.32,0:18:41.77,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,所以你得稍微夸大一点
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.32,0:18:41.77,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,so if you need to do a little exaggerating
Dialogue: 1,0:18:50.60,0:18:52.16,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你没听懂是吧
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.60,0:18:52.16,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You're not getting it, are you?
Dialogue: 1,0:18:53.24,0:18:55.72,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,夸大差不多就是说真话
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.24,0:18:55.72,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Exaggerating is like telling the truth
Dialogue: 1,0:18:55.72,0:18:58.42,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,只不过稍微加了一点谎话
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.72,0:18:58.42,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,only with little lies sprinkled in
Dialogue: 1,0:18:58.42,0:19:00.69,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,显得更真一点
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.42,0:19:00.69,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,to make it true
Dialogue: 1,0:19:01.82,0:19:04.13,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你在教我说谎吗
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.82,0:19:04.13,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You're teaching me to lie?
Dialogue: 1,0:19:04.13,0:19:05.87,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,说谎是不对的  蟹老板
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.13,0:19:05.87,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Lying is wrong, Mr. Krabs
Dialogue: 1,0:19:05.87,0:19:07.55,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不对不对不对
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.87,0:19:07.55,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,No, no, no, no, no, no
Dialogue: 1,0:19:07.55,0:19:10.20,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,夸大事实跟说谎完全不一样
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.55,0:19:10.20,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Exaggerating is completely different from lying
Dialogue: 1,0:19:10.45,0:19:12.01,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,大体上还是在说真话
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.45,0:19:12.01,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You're taking the truth
Dialogue: 1,0:19:12.01,0:19:16.15,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,一点点谎话就只是点缀
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.01,0:19:16.15,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,and just seasoning it with little lies
Dialogue: 1,0:19:16.15,0:19:19.15,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,蟹黄堡上面就算加盐
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.15,0:19:19.15,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I mean, just because you put salt on a Krabby Patty
Dialogue: 1,0:19:19.15,0:19:22.54,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,也不会变成盐黄堡  对吧
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.15,0:19:22.54,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,it doesn't make it a "salty Patty," does it?
Dialogue: 1,0:19:22.88,0:19:23.55,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,没错
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.88,0:19:23.55,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,No?
Dialogue: 1,0:19:23.55,0:19:24.72,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,那就好
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.55,0:19:24.72,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Well, good enough
Dialogue: 1,0:19:24.72,0:19:26.42,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,好好夸大事实
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.72,0:19:26.42,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Just make sure you exaggerate enough
Dialogue: 1,0:19:26.42,0:19:27.24,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,让我赢一把
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.42,0:19:27.24,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,for me to win
Dialogue: 1,0:19:34.85,0:19:38.62,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,蟹老板一直都非常
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.85,0:19:38.62,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Mr. Krabs has always been very--
Dialogue: 1,0:19:39.62,0:19:40.55,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,非常
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.62,0:19:40.55,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,the very--
Dialogue: 1,0:19:42.47,0:19:43.50,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,非常红
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.47,0:19:43.50,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,very red
Dialogue: 1,0:19:45.08,0:19:46.79,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,夸大事实
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.08,0:19:46.79,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Exaggerate
Dialogue: 1,0:19:47.70,0:19:48.37,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,蓝
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.70,0:19:48.37,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Blue
Dialogue: 1,0:19:48.53,0:19:50.70,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不对  说我小气的事
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.53,0:19:50.70,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,No, about me being cheap
Dialogue: 1,0:19:51.34,0:19:52.33,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,蟹老板是
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.34,0:19:52.33,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Mr. Krabs is--
Dialogue: 1,0:19:52.34,0:19:52.59,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.34,0:19:52.59,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,is--
Dialogue: 1,0:19:52.59,0:19:55.14,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,是非常大方的老板
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.59,0:19:55.14,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,is a very generous employer
Dialogue: 1,0:19:56.20,0:19:59.21,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不对不对  反过来夸大
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.20,0:19:59.21,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,No, no, no, no, exaggerate the other way
Dialogue: 1,0:19:59.21,0:20:00.58,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,缩小
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.21,0:20:00.58,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,De-exaggerate, um
Dialogue: 1,0:20:00.58,0:20:02.92,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,他不是为了钱
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.58,0:20:02.92,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,He's not doing it for the money
Dialogue: 1,0:20:02.92,0:20:06.47,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,一切都是为了他忠心的员工
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.92,0:20:06.47,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,He is doing it for his loyal employees
Dialogue: 1,0:20:07.20,0:20:08.79,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,他怎么还有脸活得下去
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.20,0:20:08.79,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,How can he live with himself?
Dialogue: 1,0:20:08.79,0:20:09.48,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,赶紧踢了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.79,0:20:09.48,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Get out
Dialogue: 1,0:20:09.48,0:20:10.27,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,太恶心了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.48,0:20:10.27,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Just disgusting
Dialogue: 1,0:20:10.27,0:20:12.60,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,定期休假  日常加薪
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.27,0:20:12.60,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Vacation time, regular raises
Dialogue: 1,0:20:12.60,0:20:13.67,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,利润分红
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.60,0:20:13.67,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,profit sharing
Dialogue: 1,0:20:13.67,0:20:17.07,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,都是蟹老板乐意送我们的薄礼
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.67,0:20:15.69,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,To Mr. Krabs, these are just little gifts
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.69,0:20:17.07,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,that he's glad to give us
Dialogue: 1,0:20:17.07,0:20:19.90,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,只为看见发工资时  我们的喜悦神情
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.07,0:20:18.73,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,so that he can see the look on our faces
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.73,0:20:19.90,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,when he hands us our paycheck
Dialogue: 1,0:20:21.52,0:20:22.95,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我们听够了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.52,0:20:22.95,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,We've heard enough
Dialogue: 1,0:20:22.95,0:20:24.58,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,取消资格
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.95,0:20:24.58,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Disqualified
Dialogue: 1,0:20:30.54,0:20:34.16,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,蟹老板  你在床头柜落下了苦涩泪水
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.54,0:20:34.16,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Mr. Krabs, you left some bitter tears on the nightstand
Dialogue: 1,0:20:37.15,0:20:38.02,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,谢了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.15,0:20:38.02,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Thanks
Dialogue: 1,0:20:40.77,0:20:42.37,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,开心点  蟹老板
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.77,0:20:42.37,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Cheer up, Mr. Krabs
Dialogue: 1,0:20:42.37,0:20:44.10,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你虽然确实没赢奖
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.37,0:20:44.10,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You may not have won the award
Dialogue: 1,0:20:44.10,0:20:47.31,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,但还是教会了我这海绵怎么小气
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.10,0:20:47.31,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,but you've taught this sponge a lot about stinginess
Dialogue: 1,0:20:48.14,0:20:50.83,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,差点忘了打包宾馆洗漱用品了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.14,0:20:50.83,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I almost forgot to pack these hotel toiletries
Dialogue: 1,0:20:51.18,0:20:53.98,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,也别忘了宾馆毛巾
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.18,0:20:53.98,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,And let's not forget these hotel towels
Dialogue: 1,0:20:55.51,0:20:57.98,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,可那不是偷窃吗
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.51,0:20:57.98,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,But isn't that stealing?
Dialogue: 1,0:20:57.98,0:20:59.37,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,偷窃
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.98,0:20:59.37,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Stealing?
Dialogue: 1,0:21:00.82,0:21:02.87,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,那是夸大事实
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.82,0:21:02.87,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,We're exaggerating
Dialogue: 1,0:21:04.82,0:21:08.65,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,那也能夸大这个枕头吗
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.82,0:21:08.65,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Well, could we exaggerate this pillow too?
Dialogue: 1,0:21:08.95,0:21:10.64,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,只要你能帮我
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.95,0:21:10.64,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Well, only if you help me
Dialogue: 1,0:21:10.64,0:21:12.66,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,帮我夸大这个空调就行
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.64,0:21:12.66,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,exaggerate this air conditioner
Dialogue: 1,0:21:13.65,0:21:15.00,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,当然了  小子
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.65,0:21:15.00,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Sure, boy
Dialogue: 1,0:21:15.00,0:21:19.00,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,可为什么不夸大一整面墙呢
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.00,0:21:19.00,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,But why not exaggerate the whole wall?
Dialogue: 1,0:21:36.69,0:21:39.40,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,虽然奖没赢到
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.69,0:21:39.40,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Well, I didn't win the award
Dialogue: 1,0:21:39.75,0:21:42.88,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,但跟你一起夸大事实可真愉快  小子
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.75,0:21:42.88,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,but it's been nice exaggerating with you, boy
Dialogue: 1,0:21:45.90,0:21:49.04,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,行李是否携带了宾馆物品
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.90,0:21:49.04,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Do you have any hotel property in this bag?
Dialogue: 1,0:21:49.05,0:21:50.47,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,一派胡言
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.05,0:21:50.47,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Preposterous
Dialogue: 1,0:21:50.47,0:21:51.72,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,都是我的东西
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.47,0:21:51.72,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,This is all mine
Dialogue: 1,0:21:57.44,0:22:00.13,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,看来他是想一口吃成大胖子
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.44,0:22:00.13,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Looks like he bit off more than he could chew
Dialogue: 1,0:22:06.72,0:22:09.60,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你搬走了一整间客房
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.72,0:22:09.60,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You lifted the entire hotel room?
Dialogue: 1,0:22:10.70,0:22:12.10,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,夸大事实了
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.70,0:22:12.10,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Exaggerated
Dialogue: 1,0:22:17.33,0:22:21.28,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,这是我见过最小气的行为了
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.33,0:22:21.28,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,That is the stingiest display I have ever seen
Dialogue: 1,0:22:21.90,0:22:24.28,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我宣布你们是新任获奖者
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.90,0:22:24.28,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I declare you the new winner
Dialogue: 1,0:22:28.40,0:22:29.73,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,明年见
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.40,0:22:29.73,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,See you next year
Dialogue: 1,0:22:36.17,0:22:39.61,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,谢谢你毁了一切  让我得奖
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.17,0:22:39.61,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Thanks for ruining everything so I could win
Dialogue: 1,0:22:39.82,0:22:42.00,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,握个手吧  海绵宝宝好小子
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.82,0:22:42.00,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Put her there, SpongeBob, me boy
Dialogue: 1,0:22:42.42,0:22:43.14,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,好啊
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.42,0:22:43.14,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Sure
